    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/b13e4aac4c4333be4925a407f1f8c863.poster.avif?t=1744788709\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/b13e4aac4c4333be4925a407f1f8c863.webm?t=1744788709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/b13e4aac4c4333be4925a407f1f8c863.mp4?t=1744788709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a collection of <strong>ghost stories</strong> of people climbing Everest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an anomaly, you must solve the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, your teammates will disappear one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not get out of here alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/04b519a4b377c661697cd933637275f0.poster.avif?t=1744788709\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/04b519a4b377c661697cd933637275f0.webm?t=1744788709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/04b519a4b377c661697cd933637275f0.mp4?t=1744788709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How would you solve the bizarre phenomena in this game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ever <strong>escape</strong> from this place?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/b13e4aac4c4333be4925a407f1f8c863.poster.avif?t=1744788709\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/b13e4aac4c4333be4925a407f1f8c863.webm?t=1744788709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/b13e4aac4c4333be4925a407f1f8c863.mp4?t=1744788709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a collection of <strong>ghost stories</strong> of people climbing Everest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an anomaly, you must solve the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, your teammates will disappear one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not get out of here alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/04b519a4b377c661697cd933637275f0.poster.avif?t=1744788709\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/04b519a4b377c661697cd933637275f0.webm?t=1744788709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614380/extras/04b519a4b377c661697cd933637275f0.mp4?t=1744788709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How would you solve the bizarre phenomena in this game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ever <strong>escape</strong> from this place?</p>",
